Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:02.58,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Solo los fans de\Nverdad aciertan esta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:04.10,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Tienes tres segundos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.47,0:00:10.57,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}¿En qué año salió el\Nprimer Grand Theft Auto?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.59,0:00:13.19,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}A, 1995.\NB, 1997.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.21,0:00:14.69,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}C, 2001.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.06,0:00:20.27,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}La respuesta es la B:\N1997.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.29,0:00:23.14,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Era un juego con\Nvista desde arriba,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:26.02,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}muy distinto a lo\Nque conocemos hoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.39,0:00:28.75,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Hasta GTA 3, de\N2001, la saga no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.77,0:00:31.41,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}dio el salto a las\Ntres dimensiones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.78,0:00:32.55,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}¿Acertaste?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:33.97,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Dímelo en\Ncomentarios y
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.99,0:00:35.82,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}sígueme para el\Nsiguiente quiz.
